{"title": "Snowy Liver", "pageid": 28260, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Snowy_Liver", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Snowy Liver</b> is a passive feature that grants enahnced constitution damage and resistance.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a> you have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>, and you gain <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> Modifier at the start of your turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Drunken_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Drunken_Cloth\" title=\"Drunken Cloth\">Drunken Cloth</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Snowy Liver works with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Condition)\">Drunk</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alcohol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Alcohol</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk (Drunken Master)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\">Drunk (Drunken Master)</a> conditions</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2147/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16977/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6053/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLu